From 9820b9a7d3ceffce66351938f467dda3ec10fcd0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: <user> <<user-id>@<company>.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:23:03 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(detect): recognize CodeBuddy Code (cbc) as a built-in
 agent

- add Agent::Codebuddy with label "codebuddy" and executable "cbc"
- match process names codebuddy / codebuddy-code / cbc, including node-wrapped
  launches (node .../bin/cbc) so Herdr can claim the pane foreground process
- bundle a screen manifest for CodeBuddy Code v2.172.1 (working / idle / blocked)
- register the manifest and map sound overrides to defaults

Verified: cargo test --bin herdr detect:: (105 passed); agent explain --file
reports idle / working / blocked on captured screens; agent start lists codebuddy.
---
 src/config/sound.rs                 |  1 +
 src/detect/manifest.rs              |  1 +
 src/detect/manifests/codebuddy.toml | 58 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/detect/mod.rs                   | 34 +++++++++++++++--
 4 files changed, 91 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 src/detect/manifests/codebuddy.toml

diff --git a/src/config/sound.rs b/src/config/sound.rs
